{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-transformers","title":"Graph Transformer 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-transformers","wordCount":1348,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"graph-transformer-架构\">Graph Transformer 架构</h1><p>传统 GNN 的感受野受层数限制，而过深又导致过平滑——这一矛盾催生了 Graph Transformer。通过将全局注意力引入图结构，Graph Transformer 能在保持图拓扑感知的同时捕获任意远距离的节点依赖。2024-2026 年，这一方向经历了从 naive 全注意力到线性复杂度可扩展架构的快速演进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Graph Transformer 的核心挑战在于：如何将原本为序列设计的 Transformer 适配到不规则的图结构上？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Graph Transformer 设计空间] --&gt; B[注意力范围]&#10;    A --&gt; C[位置编码]&#10;    A --&gt; D[结构偏置]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[全图注意力]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[稀疏注意力]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[混合局部+全局]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Laplacian PE]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Random Walk PE]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[相对位置编码]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[边特征注入]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[注意力偏置]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[GNN 预处理]\">graph TD\n    A[Graph Transformer 设计空间] --&gt; B[注意力范围]\n    A --&gt; C[位置编码]\n    A --&gt; D[结构偏置]\n    B --&gt; B1[全图注意力]\n    B --&gt; B2[稀疏注意力]\n    B --&gt; B3[混合局部+全局]\n    C --&gt; C1[Laplacian PE]\n    C --&gt; C2[Random Walk PE]\n    C --&gt; C3[相对位置编码]\n    D --&gt; D1[边特征注入]\n    D --&gt; D2[注意力偏置]\n    D --&gt; D3[GNN 预处理]</pre><p>与标准 Transformer 相比，Graph Transformer 的三个关键设计维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>标准 Transformer</th>\n<th>Graph Transformer</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入序列</td>\n<td>固定长度 token 序列</td>\n<td>节点集合（无固定顺序）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置编码</td>\n<td>正弦/可学习的绝对位置</td>\n<td>谱嵌入/随机游走/结构编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力模式</td>\n<td>全对全 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>稀疏（邻域）/ 全对全 / 混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构信息</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>通过边特征或注意力偏置注入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gps-通用图-transformer-框架\">GPS：通用图 Transformer 框架</h2><p>GPS（General, Powerful, Scalable）框架将局部消息传递与全局注意力统一到一个混合层中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mtext>MLP</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mtext>MPNN</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Attn</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_v^{(l+1)} = \\text{MLP}\\left(h_v^{(l)} + \\text{MPNN}(h_v^{(l)}, \\mathcal{N}(v)) + \\text{Attn}(h_v^{(l)}, V)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MLP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MPNN</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一层同时执行：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>局部 MPNN</strong>：在邻域内聚合（如 GIN、GatedGCN），保留结构归纳偏置</li>\n<li><strong>全局 Attention</strong>：对所有节点计算自注意力，捕获远程依赖</li>\n<li><strong>残差 + MLP</strong>：融合两路信息并做非线性变换</li>\n</ol>\n<p>GPS 在 Long Range Graph Benchmark（LRGB）上验证了这一混合策略显著优于纯 MPNN 或纯 Transformer。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sgformer-极简全局注意力\">SGFormer：极简全局注意力</h2><p>SGFormer（2024）挑战了&quot;Graph Transformer 必须复杂&quot;的假设。它只使用<strong>一层无 softmax 的全局注意力</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>H</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">11</mn><mi>T</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>V</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H&#x27; = \\frac{1}{N}(\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^T)HW_V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这本质上是所有节点嵌入的全局均值池化后广播——极度简化但在节点分类任务上表现惊人。其有效性源于一个反直觉的发现：<strong>对于节点分类，全图的平均信号本身就是有价值的全局上下文</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"exphormer-线性复杂度的稀疏注意力\">Exphormer：线性复杂度的稀疏注意力</h2><p>全注意力的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度限制了 Graph Transformer 的可扩展性。Exphormer 通过三种稀疏注意力模式实现线性复杂度：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>局部注意力</strong>：只关注图中的邻居（即标准 GNN）</li>\n<li><strong>Expander 注意力</strong>：基于 expander graph 的稀疏全局连接</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟节点注意力</strong>：所有节点通过少量虚拟全局节点间接通信</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Attn</mtext><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Local</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Expander</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">E</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Virtual</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Attn}_{sparse}(v) = \\text{Local}(\\mathcal{N}(v)) + \\text{Expander}(\\mathcal{E}_{exp}(v)) + \\text{Virtual}(v_{global})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Local</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Expander</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0894em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0894em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Virtual</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这三种模式的稀疏性保证了每层计算复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（假设图是稀疏的），同时理论上证明了其在区分图结构方面的表达力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gist-2026-年的规范不变谱-transformer\">GIST：2026 年的规范不变谱 Transformer</h2><p>GIST（Gauge-Invariant Spectral Transformer）是 2026 年 3 月提出的架构，解决了谱位置编码在归纳学习中的核心难题——<strong>规范歧义性</strong>（gauge ambiguity）。</p>\n<p>谱嵌入的特征向量存在符号和旋转自由度：数值求解器可能对相同的图产生不同的特征向量方向，导致模型在训练和推理时看到不一致的位置编码。GIST 的解决方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用随机投影代替精确特征分解，实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度</li>\n<li>在投影后的嵌入上使用<strong>内积型注意力</strong>，天然对符号翻转不变</li>\n<li>多尺度架构捕获不同频率的结构信息</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实验表明，GIST 在网格分辨率迁移任务上显著优于需要精确特征分解的方法——这对物理模拟等需要跨离散化泛化的应用至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分布式训练的可扩展性突破\">分布式训练的可扩展性突破</h2><p>2026 年 DAC 会议上，Lin 等人提出了 Graph Transformer 的分布式训练框架，通过两种并行策略解决大图训练难题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>通信模式</th>\n<th>内存优化</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GP-AG（Graph Parallelism + All-Gather）</td>\n<td>收集完整邻域</td>\n<td>稀疏格式存储</td>\n<td>低度图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GP-A2A（Graph Parallelism + All-to-All）</td>\n<td>点对点特征交换</td>\n<td>不存储远程特征</td>\n<td>高度图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配合自动策略选择算法（AGP-S），系统根据图结构和硬件带宽自动切换最优策略，在 8 GPU 上实现 6 倍加速，内存消耗降低 78%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与传统-gnn-的对比\">与传统 GNN 的对比</h2><p>什么时候用 Graph Transformer 而非经典 GNN？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>小图（&lt;1K 节点）</td>\n<td>Graph Transformer</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 可接受，全局依赖有价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大图（&gt;100K 节点）</td>\n<td>MPNN + 虚拟节点</td>\n<td>全注意力不可行，稀疏 GT 仍在发展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要长程依赖</td>\n<td>GPS / Exphormer</td>\n<td>混合架构兼顾两者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图分类任务</td>\n<td>Graph Transformer</td>\n<td>全局 readout 自然匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点分类 + 同质图</td>\n<td>经典 GCN/GAT</td>\n<td>局部扩散已足够</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Graph Transformer 通过全局注意力突破 GNN 的感受野限制</li>\n<li>GPS 框架统一局部 MPNN + 全局 Attention，是当前最通用的方案</li>\n<li>Exphormer/GIST 实现线性复杂度，推动 GT 向大规模应用扩展</li>\n<li>位置编码（谱/随机游走/结构）是 GT 区别于标准 Transformer 的关键</li>\n<li>分布式训练框架（2026）使 GT 具备了图基础模型的训练能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章节：<a href=\"graph-convolutional-networks\">图卷积网络家族</a>是 Graph Transformer 的&quot;局部注意力&quot;前身</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../causal-inference/causal-fundamentals/causal-graphs\">因果推断 - 因果图模型</a>中的 DAG 结构也可用 Transformer 进行因果发现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Graph Transformer 架构","id":"graph-transformer-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GPS：通用图 Transformer 框架","id":"gps-通用图-transformer-框架"},{"level":2,"text":"SGFormer：极简全局注意力","id":"sgformer-极简全局注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"Exphormer：线性复杂度的稀疏注意力","id":"exphormer-线性复杂度的稀疏注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"GIST：2026 年的规范不变谱 Transformer","id":"gist-2026-年的规范不变谱-transformer"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式训练的可扩展性突破","id":"分布式训练的可扩展性突破"},{"level":2,"text":"与传统 GNN 的对比","id":"与传统-gnn-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"图卷积网络家族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-convolutional-networks"},"next":{"title":"异构图与时序图神经网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/architectures/heterogeneous-temporal-gnns"}}